            "review_title": "Review at Gánh - Đặc sản Nha Trang",
            "review_text": "Nhi Nguyen\n2 contributions\n0\nGood good Good service\nJul 2026 • Friends\nI had a wonderful dining experience at this restaurant. The menu is extensive, offering a great variety of local Nha Trang specialties, and every dish we tried was delicious and full of flavor.\n\nThe grilled fish was definitely the highlight of the meal. Paired with the signature green chili fish sauce, it was absolutely addictive! The prawns with mayonnaise were also a big hit with the kids—they loved them. Another pleasant surprise was the Ganh juice, which was unique and very tasty.\n\nThe restaurant is spacious, beautifully designed, and conveniently located in the city center, making it easy to visit. They also have private dining rooms, which are perfect for family gatherings or special occasions.\n\nMost importantly, the staff were friendly, attentive, and provided excellent service throughout our visit.\n\nI highly recommend this restaurant to anyone visiting Nha Trang. Great food, great atmosphere, and outstanding service. I will definitely come back!\nRead more\nWritten July 18, 2026",
