            "review_text": "Heng\nSingapore, Singapore5140 contributions\n0\nAlways use calculator to check your change\nNov 2024 • Family\nThis being my first meal in HCMC after a hiatus of 12 years, I would have given 4 stars but after a day in hcmc, I would say that this is probably 3 as there are much better and fresher food elsewhere. That said, this still serve as a good introduction to Vietnamese food. \n\nOne thing of special note here is to always use a calculator to check your change as the denominations are so big that you might miscount. Take your time too. Don’t get hurried. \n\nWhat I appreciate about the service here is that they readily explain the usage of each sauce as different food goes with different sauce. Of course, service level differs with different person. Bonus is that they speak English. \n\nAmbience wise, definitely good and the air conditioning is definitely big welcome as I had a red eye flight but little to no sleep. And the decongest is so homey and welcoming. \n\nPrice wise, reasonable Vietnamese restaurant price.\nRead more\nWritten November 25, 2024",
